New this August: Product updates you should know	
	
 	
 <https://image.email.buildertrend.com/lib/fe3515717564047a7d1372/m/1/a5dde278-02ba-407d-99c9-1bfb8ca32eab.png> 	
Carry specs from estimates to bids	
Keep scope connected from estimating through bidding. Specifications linked to cost groups now carry automatically into bid packages, ensuring subcontractors receive the same detailed scope you used to build the estimate while eliminating the need to manually re-link specifications.	
 	
 <https://image.email.buildertrend.com/lib/fe3515717564047a7d1372/m/1/5c1ea1eb-d882-4f2c-85bb-c80290c32ac4.png> 	
Enhanced Specs and Plans notifications	
Keep the right people informed without creating unnecessary noise. You can now choose exactly who to notify when publishing a specification, giving you more control over project communication while ensuring stakeholders receive the updates that matter most.	
 	
 <https://image.email.buildertrend.com/lib/fe3515717564047a7d1372/m/1/ba37ac7d-410d-4cc4-9249-cdef021fa9f9.png> 	
Track and report on bill rates on Time Clock shifts	
Connect labor tracking directly to client billing. You can now define bill rates separately from employee cost rates, allowing labor charges to flow automatically from Time Clock to Invoices. This eliminates manual calculations, improves billing accuracy and gives you greater confidence that every billable hour is captured correctly.	
 	
 <https://image.email.buildertrend.com/lib/fe3515717564047a7d1372/m/1/c2882a90-30ea-4bae-b646-19b0b3f20f3b.png> 	
Global Specs catalog	
Manage specifications from one centralized catalog. You can now build reusable specification templates, organize them alongside your Cost Catalog and pull them into jobs as needed. This creates greater consistency across projects, reduces repetitive work and makes it easier to standardize scope from estimate through execution.	
